{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7fe0ef7767b8354fec0f4de5c42ef924d481286495770850289761189fc00081", "ja": "律子、ブログ読んだぞ。\nあの写真、シックで大人っぽくて、すごく良かったよ。", "zh": "律子，我看过部落格了。\n那张照片既高雅又有成熟韵味，非常棒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "d0619d055b9ede0ae5108303f3cf229e3f6c7d5275ef7b16412131db3b4215e8", "ja": "{$P$}、見てくれたんですね。\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}，你看了吗？\n谢谢夸奖！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2ac97222b7540cdc4ee1b5194f687f7754c600d4d4ed625235c2afd1ff2ee0d7", "ja": "律子の雰囲気ともマッチしてるし、\nこういう大人路線を推していくのも良さそうだな。", "zh": "那张照片很符合律子的气质，\n主打这种成熟路线好像也不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "a4adde8dbc5eacd36fc596627cbb93409783c36f60b409476c4d62e01c96d2f9", "ja": "あはは、お褒めにあずかり光栄です。\nそうですね。新しいファン層も獲得できるかも！", "zh": "哈哈，很荣幸能得到你的赞美。\n不过你这么说也是，或许还能拓展新的粉丝客群呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "006fb17de98739c1a24d5e2c8d1260f042936db1b672e3a5cf60079341409b61", "ja": "大人な衣装の大人なアイドル、秋月律子。……うん、\nちょっと寂しい気もするけど、いいんじゃないですか？", "zh": "成熟装扮的成熟偶像，秋月律子……\n嗯，虽然听起来有点寂寞，但应该不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1005_p", "source_sha256": "36781c9f98cd9ae1e4563812316658b1bd0aaa7867728d2540e39389b9132890", "ja": "寂しい？", "zh": "寂寞？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "119ddc7a6092a9c2079dbb027caae7689a4e937adb0ef60744d64f3a0782bbeb", "ja": "ああ……えーっと……。ほら、もうすぐ私も\nほんとに大人になっちゃうじゃないですか。", "zh": "啊……就是……你想想嘛，\n再过不久我就要到成人的年纪了，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "913e9b8ea9e4ca92d11cc50169e22bc02f4966e61afe5ac5c57195e0f4a57931", "ja": "そして、その後……何年後かの私って、たぶん毎日\nスーツとか、落ち着いた格好してると思うんですよね。", "zh": "而在成年之后……许多年后的我，\n大概每天都会穿着套装之类的稳重装扮吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8cd8632378049bbc22085271b07f47c7ba18f5c9f54ae7763f3c6c6666086a40", "ja": "……まあ、そんな姿が想像つくなあ。", "zh": "……嗯，那幅情景的确不难想像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "78be64ec1cdcee5f893d04c08e05d55caf453008bbee5bb5018382f95d9f0606", "ja": "もちろん、そういうピシッとして機能的なスタイル、\n好きだからいいんですけど……。", "zh": "当然，我本来就喜欢那种俐落方便的穿着，\n所以是无所谓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "7fcfdfb06071232deea2c1f358a271ad7e5bfb364a4cd4aafd3dad3a66bae606", "ja": "でも、今は、こういう大人っぽい衣装の日もあれば、\nみんなとお揃いの、かわいい衣装の日もあって。", "zh": "可是现在，除了穿着这种成熟风格的服装，\n有时也会穿上和大家一样的可爱服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "23a33fc6112417305c6e0dfee305608be61e0a7f6e36578135cc614b07eaa187", "ja": "毎日いろんな自分になれる……。自分でも予測できない\nそんな『今』が、なんだかすごく楽しいんです。", "zh": "每天都能变身成不同模样的自己……\n连我自己都无法预测的『现在』，真的很快乐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "9e46ebc8cda909a76652e86b30134c0549d8affef85080afdf87bd3b84b50608", "ja": "あっ、でも、プロデュース的な観点からは、\n方向性を固定した方がいいのかな……？", "zh": "啊，不过就培育偶像的观点来看，\n还是固定往一个方向发展比较好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4a455367fa44dc672faef3061d97463d139e385d30b990716c4ed823a6ffb49a", "ja": "どうかな？　別に、ムリに決めなくていいと思うけど。\n大人っぽい方向性も、可能性のひとつというか。", "zh": "会吗？我倒觉得不必勉强固定发展方向。\n成熟路线就当作是其中一种可能性吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5174b17fa70e318f7b1c740a6cdb4f0938cca25f7f4a35f920585f29b4c877b7", "ja": "ほら、特定の生き方にしばられない柔軟性、みたいな\nものも、モダンガールのかっこよさのひとつだろ？", "zh": "不受限于特定生活方式的柔软态度，\n也是摩登女孩的魅力之一，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "7773c08efbb8bbe299c4a2c1e2c4825b47bac5b06316dd4b1eed77ad29b6c85b", "ja": "ん？　……ふふふ。うまいこと言った～、とか\n思ってるでしょ？　{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯……？呵呵呵，你该不会是觉得自己说了句名言，\n因此得意起来了吧？{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e3ffbd53822f8b238934185c12f29b44123c611698bdc158ef08aea096d2f8e4", "ja": "いや、そんなつもりじゃ……。俺はただ、\n律子の魅力を限定するのはもったいないって……。", "zh": "没有，我没那么想……我只是觉得，\n把律子的魅力限制住太可惜了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "6783e86b5898d33e8917d368f223412c4535b0530879d8c66037b14b597f5e7f", "ja": "はいはい、ありがとうございます。ふふっ。\nそれじゃ、お言葉に甘えて……。", "zh": "好好好，谢谢夸奖，呵呵。\n那么，我就恭敬不如从命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "7a4233c9e9629208314fa4b6698fe0ba3be43bcd630135331ebc25c7bcd86a23", "ja": "これからも、いろいろ挑戦させてもらいますから。\n覚悟してくださいね、{$P$}殿！", "zh": "以后我也会继续挑战各种工作的。\n麻烦你做好心理准备啦，{$P$}阁下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2001f2dbf79b05b485fb25e13d3829773590f999acd6247d6462316886f1fcf1", "ja": "（大人っぽく見えても、律子は19歳の女の子。\n可能性を絞り込むのは早すぎるだろう）", "zh": "（虽然看起来成熟稳重，但律子终究是19岁的女孩。\n要限缩她的可能性还太早了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0084_1020_p", "source_sha256": "bfbeac012f9bd899e4291597af4f4eadc68fd43a184ea7f24d71954aff630608", "ja": "（律子の色々な可能性を、毎日模索していく。\nそんなプロデュースができたら、実にハイカラだな！）", "zh": "（每天不断发掘律子各式各样的可能性。\n要是能做到这样的培育，就真能称得上摩登啰！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
